# A design input. In a finished build the player flips the lever. Tests (and the
# playground) drive it by swapping the lever's stone block for a redstone block,
# because changing a lever's state with a command does not power anything.
tile input
size 5 4 5
port E out 4 1 2
probe 0 1 2

legend
  G minecraft:glass
  # minecraft:stone
  / minecraft:lever[face=floor,facing=east,powered=false]
  - minecraft:redstone_wire

layer 0
  .....
  .....
  .GGGG
  .....
  .....
layer 1
  .....
  .....
  #----
  .....
  .....
layer 2
  .....
  .....
  /....
  .....
  .....
